2. ours/   —   Apache-2.0 (this work)

   The WAN-TC latent-diffusion reward wrapper (ours/reward_models/) and the
   DrQ-v2 training / calibration scripts (ours/scripts/).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
3. TSEncoder/   —   the reward model (ditar_encoder)

   The task-relevant encoder + flow-matching latent diffusion, including its
   full training code. It is imported lazily by ours/reward_models and is an
   optional runtime dependency of the RL code (see CHECKPOINTS.md).

   It builds on the frozen WAN 2.2 video-model VAE and a T5 text encoder, which
   are downloaded from HuggingFace at runtime and remain under their own
   licenses; honour those where their weights or code are redistributed.
